# Upstream ignores skills/ because skills are normally created at runtime in
# HERMES_HOME. This fork versions a Forge skill and ships it in the image, so
# the directory must be tracked. Runtime-created skills still live in the
# volume and are never committed.
!skills/
overview.md
LOCAL.md
RAILWAY.md
